        "evidence_id": "pdfplumber:abstract",
        "source": "pdf_layout",
        "field": "abstract",
        "raw_text": "We propose a general technique to improve the key-guessing step of several attacks on block ciphers. This is achieved by defining and studying some new properties of the associated S-boxes and by rep- resenting them as a special type of decision trees that are crucial for finding fine-grained guessing strategies for various attack vectors. We have proposed and implemented the algorithm that efficiently finds such trees, and use it for providing several applications of this approach, which include the best known attacks onNoekeon, GIFT, and RECTANGLE.",
